  "question": {
    "text": "A capacitor is made of a flat plate of area A and a second plate having a stair-like structure as shown in figure. If the area of each stair is $\\frac{A}{3}$ and the height is $d$, the capacitance of the arrangement is :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/oeqDJn3KBv6PtOgwnvGlZR-JBKw-cwVUpKx0j0fuDvA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "CVr56",
      "text": "$\\frac{13 \\epsilon_o A}{17 d}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "aiY03",
      "text": "$\\frac{11 \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{o}} \\mathrm{A}}{18 \\mathrm{~d}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cgTZr",
      "text": "$\\frac{18 \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{o}} \\mathrm{A}}{11 \\mathrm{~d}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "kQmgu",
      "text": "$\\frac{11 \\epsilon_{\\mathrm{o}} \\mathrm{A}}{20 \\mathrm{~d}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "All capacitor are in parallel combination.\nAlso effective area is common area only\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\Rightarrow C_{\\text {eq }}=C_1+C_2+C_3 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow C_{\\text {eq }}=\\frac{A \\varepsilon_0}{3 d}+\\frac{A \\varepsilon_0}{3(2 d)}+\\frac{A \\varepsilon_0}{3(3 d)} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow C_{\\text {eq }}=\\frac{A \\varepsilon_0}{3}\\left(\\frac{11}{6 d}\\right) \\\\ & \\Rightarrow C_{\\text {eq }}=\\frac{11 A \\varepsilon_0}{18 d}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
